Package: com.fleetfinch.app
Name: Fleet Finch
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Cleans up, patches and extends iOS 9 devices
 The main Fleet Finch app: utilities to remove stock apps, stock services and
 Cydia, patch the system and its certificates, an app store for apps, tools
 and extensions, and settings the stock Settings app does not have.
Maintainer: FleetFinch
Author: FleetFinch
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 9.0)
